    { name = 'Featherweight', group = 'Content Quests', desc = 'Start: Yagudo Outlaw in Castle Oztroja (I-9). Level 50+. Modes: CW. Repeatable after every JP Midnight. Source: https://www.bg-wiki.com/index.php?title=CatsEyeXI_Systems/Quests', steps = {
