    { name = 'Up, Up and Away', group = 'System Quests', desc = 'Start: Disarmed Knight in Lower Delkfutt\'s Tower (E-10) (Map 1). Level 30+. Modes: ACE CW WEW. After: None. Source: https://www.bg-wiki.com/index.php?title=CatsEyeXI_Systems/Quests', steps = {
